OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Stanningley to San Andreas -
OL,4,Ahow Yorkshire helped shape Grand Theft
OL,5,AAuto VI
OL,6,
OL,7,FGrand Theft Auto VI launches on
OL,8,FThursday - and the video game will
OL,9,Flikely dominate timelines, feeds and
OL,10,Fdebates for years. Leeds may lack the
OL,11,Fsun-soaked glamour of previous game
OL,12,Flocations Vice City or San Andreas, but
OL,13,Fcan Yorkshire really claim the title as
OL,14,Fits own? Some developers believe so.
OL,16,FThere's not much more to be written,
OL,17,Fread or said about the launch of Grand
OL,18,FTheft Auto VI - but bear with me.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
