OL,3,GNEWSAFrom Stanningley to San Andreas -
OL,4,Ahow Yorkshire helped shape Grand Theft
OL,5,AAuto VI
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnalysts believe Rockstar's
OL,8,Faction-adventure game could become the
OL,9,Fmost expensive ever made - with
OL,10,Festimates putting development costs at
OL,11,Fmore than $1bn (#866m).
OL,13,FThe release follows 13 years of work
OL,14,Ffor the global company - which has used
OL,15,Fthe gaming industry in Yorkshire for
OL,16,Finspiration.
